{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-15",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "打听门禁系统记录  (Asking the Editors for Access Logs)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "wang_er": "王尔",
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Guessing immediately that Chun Yuqiao deleted the master cut himself, Bu Xiaogu calls senior editors Wang Er and Xie Ling aside for an urgent private favour. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，你给我们发信息有什么急事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "两位老师，咱们算是好哥们儿吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "谁跟你是哥们儿，咱们不是闺蜜吗？到底怎么了，快说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有件私事想求你们两位帮忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你吓我一跳，我还以为是总编室找我们改片子的事呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想知道后期中心门禁系统的密码。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "小谷，这种事情可千万别开玩笑啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道你们跟保安私下关系很好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚进公司的时候，你们让我去素材房，并没有留下任何痕迹，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次就再用这种办法帮我一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，我们都是公司的铁杆，玩归玩闹归闹，可从来没做过伤害公司的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也是公司的铁杆，我真的很信任你们，如果你们不帮我，以前的事我还记着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你是不是只想看一眼系统记录？其他事情可跟我们没关系！",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，你给我们发信息有什么急事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, what urgent matter made you text the two of us?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "两位老师，咱们算是好哥们儿吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Teachers, the three of us count as good buddies, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "谁跟你是哥们儿，咱们不是闺蜜吗？到底怎么了，快说。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Who says buddies—are we not besties? What is going on, tell us.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有件私事想求你们两位帮忙。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I have a personal favour to ask the two of you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你吓我一跳，我还以为是总编室找我们改片子的事呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You startled me—I thought the editorial office was calling us about re-editing the show.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想知道后期中心门禁系统的密码。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I want to know the password to the post-production centre's door access system.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "小谷，这种事情可千万别开玩笑啊！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, you must never joke around about something like that!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道你们跟保安私下关系很好。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know the two of you are on great private terms with security.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我刚进公司的时候，你们让我去素材房，并没有留下任何痕迹，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'When I first joined the company, you let me into the footage room without leaving any trace, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "这次就再用这种办法帮我一下吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Please help me out one more time using that same method.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，我们都是公司的铁杆，玩归玩闹归闹，可从来没做过伤害公司的事。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaogu, we are diehard Xingtian loyalists; joking aside, we have never done anything to harm the company.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我也是公司的铁杆，我真的很信任你们，如果你们不帮我，以前的事我还记着呢。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I am loyal to the company too and truly trust you—though if you refuse, I still remember that old incident.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你是不是只想看一眼系统记录？其他事情可跟我们没关系！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you only want a quick look at the system log? Anything else has nothing to do with us!'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "小谷，你给我们发信息有什么急事啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "两位老师，咱们算是好哥们儿吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "谁跟你是哥们儿，咱们不是闺蜜吗？到底怎么了，快说。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我有件私事想求你们两位帮忙。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "wang_er",
      "t": "你吓我一跳，我还以为是总编室找我们改片子的事呢。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我想知道后期中心门禁系统的密码。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "小谷，这种事情可千万别开玩笑啊！",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
